WEBVTT

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.368
Never have I lost so disgracefully!

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:38.246
This makes my having joined
the platoon meaningless!

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:40.081
Cut that out, Siena.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:41.958
Don't address me like that!

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:43.793
Just calm down.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:46.921
<i>I was overly confident in my abilities.</i>

00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:50.675
<i>I didn't dream I'd relied</i>
<i>on Layfon to this extent...</i>

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:54.596
You...

00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:58.141
What is it? Has something
happened with my brother?

00:00:58.141 --> 00:01:01.102
I have been entrusted with
a message from Layfon Alseif

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:02.979
to Nina Antalk.

00:01:03.355 --> 00:01:04.773
From Layfon?

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:07.442
Please head to the machinery
department at once.

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:10.445
Zuellni has developed... an aberration.

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:13.198
The president can provide more details--

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:14.115
H-Hey!

00:01:14.115 --> 00:01:15.742
Nina!

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:21.956
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:25.543
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:01:25.543 --> 00:01:33.259
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:38.807
<i>Roaming around the city having lost my map</i>

00:01:38.807 --> 00:01:42.143
<i>Even a dying world</i>

00:01:42.143 --> 00:01:48.942
<i>Let me hear a life deep</i>
<i>within that won't stop running</i>

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:52.070
<i>I seared the undying light into my eyes</i>

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:55.490
<i>Refusing to shut them</i>
<i>even when they dried</i>

00:01:55.490 --> 00:02:02.288
<i>I don't believe anything I can</i>
<i>obtain without getting hurt</i>

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:08.420
<i>A single emotion</i>
<i>directed toward someone</i>

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:15.677
<i>Splits the steel darkness</i>
<i>like the light of morning</i>

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:20.348
<i>One day brave your</i>
<i>truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:20.348 --> 00:02:23.810
<i>So you will drastically change</i>

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:29.899
<i>Compounded strength and prayers</i>

00:02:29.899 --> 00:02:33.570
<i>Intersecting futures</i>
<i>and wishes held close</i>

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:37.073
<i>I will give these to no one</i>

00:02:37.073 --> 00:02:38.575
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:02:38.575 --> 00:02:43.788
<i>It links our hearts</i>

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.504
Just what is going on?

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:53.423
The city is running amok.

00:02:53.423 --> 00:02:54.966
What did you say?!

00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:57.302
It is running amok.

00:02:57.302 --> 00:02:59.429
It is attempting, of its
own volition, to dive headfirst

00:02:59.429 --> 00:03:01.139
into a group of contaminoids.

00:03:01.139 --> 00:03:04.225
Is that why you sent Layfon out again?

00:03:04.225 --> 00:03:06.603
He's only just had surgery!

00:03:06.603 --> 00:03:08.188
In his condition...

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:12.942
That battle against the juveniles
should have brought home to you

00:03:12.942 --> 00:03:15.362
just how inexperienced we were.

00:03:16.613 --> 00:03:19.616
It was the same when fighting
the elder contaminoids as well.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.786
True, your team has
made contributions of its own...

00:03:22.827 --> 00:03:26.915
but do you really think
you could have won without him?

00:03:26.915 --> 00:03:30.168
There is no choice but to rely on his strength.

00:03:30.168 --> 00:03:34.214
That, unfortunately, is the truth we face.

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:38.385
He did say, however, that he
would not mind if you all went as well,

00:03:38.385 --> 00:03:40.387
if you so desired.

00:03:40.845 --> 00:03:43.640
I do not understand his intentions.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:46.017
Please ask him directly.

00:03:46.935 --> 00:03:48.770
What shall you do?

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.355
I will not go.

00:03:50.355 --> 00:03:51.523
Oh?

00:03:51.523 --> 00:03:54.150
I have something else to do.

00:03:55.985 --> 00:03:57.445
Are you listening?

00:03:57.445 --> 00:03:58.863
Yes.

00:03:58.947 --> 00:04:01.324
We're going to where Layfon is?

00:04:01.324 --> 00:04:02.951
Yes. Please do.

00:04:02.951 --> 00:04:04.953
Is everything okay on your end?

00:04:04.953 --> 00:04:08.081
I don't know.
But I don't anticipate any support there.

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:12.335
Roger! I will have faith... O fearless leader.

00:04:12.335 --> 00:04:17.382
I don't know what you intend to do, but it
seems you have an agreement with Layfon-<i>kun</i>.

00:04:17.382 --> 00:04:19.968
I wish you good fighting.

00:04:20.969 --> 00:04:24.514
"Salinban Mercenary Training Group, Move Out!"

00:04:33.648 --> 00:04:37.861
Shouldn't you be getting
a bit more bed rest, hmm?

00:04:40.071 --> 00:04:41.906
Over there.

00:04:49.789 --> 00:04:53.626
There are twelve of them.
Just as our information said.

00:04:58.256 --> 00:05:03.428
We'll take on half of them, six.
That's the deal.

00:05:03.428 --> 00:05:07.182
I know. You seem to have
made yourself quite the bargain.

00:05:07.182 --> 00:05:10.602
You're gonna start criticizing <i>me </i>about money?

00:05:12.854 --> 00:05:16.941
Your president could raise
enough money for six contaminoids.

00:05:16.941 --> 00:05:20.362
He said you guys would
use your own military power

00:05:20.362 --> 00:05:22.072
to deal with the rest somehow.

00:05:22.072 --> 00:05:23.907
Restoration-AD.

00:05:25.158 --> 00:05:28.745
Hang on a second. They're still sleeping.

00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:31.706
Their shells will be weaker and easier to crack

00:05:31.706 --> 00:05:33.333
once they're awake.

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:38.254
Whatever. I'm fine with taking care
of my share of them first.

00:05:39.381 --> 00:05:43.885
Don't say it like that! Yours truly
would like to try fighting alongside you...

00:05:43.885 --> 00:05:46.596
Mr. Former Heaven's Blade.

00:05:54.479 --> 00:05:56.773
Just where do you think you're going?

00:05:56.773 --> 00:06:00.151
I thought we'd start out
with a little group social activity.

00:06:00.735 --> 00:06:02.654
Cut the crap!

00:06:02.987 --> 00:06:05.448
I'm being serious.

00:06:05.448 --> 00:06:07.075
Sharnid!

00:06:07.617 --> 00:06:12.080
It's not too late to answer after
you've stuck around a bit longer.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.290
With the 17th Platoon.

00:06:24.467 --> 00:06:28.471
<i>The city's running amok? </i>
<i>What's happened to her?</i>

00:06:34.519 --> 00:06:36.104
Zuellni!

00:06:36.104 --> 00:06:38.356
Zuellni! Are you here?

00:06:38.356 --> 00:06:43.695
It's me, Nina!

00:07:25.737 --> 00:07:27.739
You've got to leave.

00:07:29.824 --> 00:07:31.659
Hello there.

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:37.123
Face-Man!

00:07:37.457 --> 00:07:41.294
You're really beginning to annoy me, Inspector.

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:44.547
Looking for me? What do you want?

00:07:44.547 --> 00:07:46.966
It's my job to catch criminals!

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:50.428
What a nerve. Especially with you on the take.

00:07:50.428 --> 00:07:52.889
Anyway, I'd have to get rid of anyone

00:07:52.889 --> 00:07:55.684
who'd dare to interfere
with my natural behavior.

00:07:55.684 --> 00:07:57.686
Wait a minute.

00:08:23.253 --> 00:08:24.879
Zuellni!

00:08:28.883 --> 00:08:30.635
Why are you here?

00:08:30.635 --> 00:08:34.806
Why, damn it? Fallen One!

00:08:37.225 --> 00:08:38.852
Restoration!

00:08:48.611 --> 00:08:50.030
I...

00:08:51.072 --> 00:08:55.827
My body has fallen to dust,
no longer serving its purpose.

00:08:55.827 --> 00:09:02.250
Now but spirit, mad hatred
drives me to become the fire of change.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:08.423
I seek a new lord, that I might be
renewed and have renewed purpose.

00:09:08.423 --> 00:09:11.760
Come, you who desires the flame!

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:16.931
Do so, and I shall become the blade
that sweeps aside Ignacius's filth

00:09:16.931 --> 00:09:21.436
and turn all your enemies to ash.

00:09:22.645 --> 00:09:26.983
Is that you talking to me? What do you mean?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:31.946
To gain one who is
worthy of possessing my spirit,

00:09:31.946 --> 00:09:34.699
I must take action.

00:09:35.325 --> 00:09:40.080
Did you do something to Zuellni?!

00:09:40.538 --> 00:09:45.126
It is circumstance that
changes man, causes growth.

00:09:48.004 --> 00:09:51.716
Zuellni! Release Zuellni!

00:09:51.716 --> 00:09:55.970
You do not possess the proper
extremity of sentiment.

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:59.516
However, you are strangely sympathetic.

00:10:00.809 --> 00:10:03.937
You have thoughts of protecting this city...

00:10:03.937 --> 00:10:06.147
Then I shall use you as a test.

00:10:06.147 --> 00:10:08.983
Though you do not have the
ultimate sentiment to sustain me,

00:10:08.983 --> 00:10:12.404
let us wager all on your sympathy.

00:10:28.878 --> 00:10:30.714
Stop it...

00:10:31.965 --> 00:10:35.343
Stop it!

00:10:36.136 --> 00:10:38.638
Send someone to the machinery
department? Why?

00:10:38.638 --> 00:10:40.306
Just do it!

00:10:40.306 --> 00:10:42.517
Something has happened to our leader!

00:11:02.871 --> 00:11:05.415
You can look all you want...

00:11:05.832 --> 00:11:08.335
But you can't see Glendan anymore.

00:11:08.335 --> 00:11:11.421
I know. More to the point...

00:11:11.421 --> 00:11:14.174
Savalis-<i>sama</i>, why are you here?

00:11:15.425 --> 00:11:18.636
I'd prefer it if you tried not to say my name.

00:11:19.554 --> 00:11:22.265
I'm sorry. But...

00:11:22.265 --> 00:11:26.019
I have to go to another city
for a top-secret mission.

00:11:26.394 --> 00:11:30.106
This will be a long trip.
Let's make the most of it.

00:11:30.106 --> 00:11:32.317
O-Okay.

00:11:39.199 --> 00:11:43.328
Rather than capturing the Fallen One,
your priority should be

00:11:43.328 --> 00:11:45.663
ensuring Leerin's safety.

00:11:46.039 --> 00:11:47.332
Your Majesty!

00:11:47.332 --> 00:11:51.002
I won't allow a single hair
on her head to be hurt.

00:11:51.378 --> 00:11:54.839
I will crush you, <i>squish</i>!

00:11:54.839 --> 00:11:58.426
And if she asks something of you,
you must obey.

00:11:58.426 --> 00:12:01.388
You may consider it an
order from the queen herself.

00:12:02.639 --> 00:12:08.019
And if Leerin-<i>san</i>'s order should
show disregard for her life?

00:12:08.019 --> 00:12:11.481
You must, of course, keep her safe.

00:12:11.481 --> 00:12:16.027
You must also, of course, obey her.
Do them both.

00:12:16.027 --> 00:12:18.863
Do you not often boast
of being a Heaven's Blade?

00:12:20.115 --> 00:12:22.659
I do not boast to that extent.

00:12:22.659 --> 00:12:25.286
Shut up. Just do it!

00:12:41.261 --> 00:12:42.929
Layfon-<i>dono</i>.

00:12:43.304 --> 00:12:47.809
Please forgive Haia's affront toward you.

00:12:52.689 --> 00:12:56.901
He has always had an interest in you.

00:12:56.901 --> 00:12:58.486
Interest?

00:12:58.486 --> 00:13:02.615
I also thought that I would like to meet you.

00:13:02.615 --> 00:13:05.827
Though as you at present
have no plans to return to Glendan,

00:13:05.827 --> 00:13:07.454
I had given up hope.

00:13:07.454 --> 00:13:11.166
What does the queen intend
to do with the Fallen Ones?

00:13:11.166 --> 00:13:15.879
I do not know.
But the Salinban Mercenary Training Group

00:13:15.879 --> 00:13:20.550
was originally formed in
order to bring back Fallen Ones.

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:24.262
The royal family may have some use for them...

00:13:25.055 --> 00:13:27.766
What are you doing?

00:13:28.558 --> 00:13:30.477
Senior... Felli?

00:13:30.477 --> 00:13:34.689
It will be a little longer before
my terminal arrives there.

00:13:34.689 --> 00:13:38.318
Thus, I am borrowing this person's terminal.

00:13:38.318 --> 00:13:43.490
That's incredible. You attuned
with it without disrupting my nen'i?

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:46.409
Sorry, but right now
this is a matter for this idiot,

00:13:46.409 --> 00:13:50.705
who is doing something
incredibly idiotic. Please leave.

00:13:56.169 --> 00:13:57.587
Um...

00:13:59.422 --> 00:14:00.882
I'm sorry.

00:14:00.882 --> 00:14:05.720
Beginning with an apology is commendable.
We understand the situation.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:08.139
To think that there's no
choice but to rely on you...

00:14:08.515 --> 00:14:12.602
I'm quite appalled at Zuellni's low level.

00:14:12.602 --> 00:14:14.479
That's not what's going on.

00:14:14.729 --> 00:14:19.025
Zuellni is an academic city.
I'm sure this is normal.

00:14:19.442 --> 00:14:24.614
Charming. Then why did you call us?

00:14:24.614 --> 00:14:26.199
To watch.

00:14:26.199 --> 00:14:29.035
Watch? The battle against the contaminoids?

00:14:29.035 --> 00:14:33.289
Yes. And I'd like you to
record footage of it, if you can.

00:14:33.289 --> 00:14:35.125
Is it possible?

00:14:37.335 --> 00:14:40.130
It should be. I will try.

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:41.715
Thank you very much.

00:14:42.048 --> 00:14:45.343
If I only show you and the others
and can't show our leader,

00:14:45.343 --> 00:14:47.762
I'll be yelled at for it later.

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:51.683
Our leader has gone to Zuellni, hasn't she?

00:14:53.643 --> 00:14:54.686
Yes.

00:14:54.686 --> 00:14:57.439
Something seems to have happened to Zuellni.

00:14:57.439 --> 00:15:00.275
Nina is sure to straighten things out.

00:15:03.361 --> 00:15:08.158
All right, you and the others stay
somewhere where you can watch the fight.

00:15:08.158 --> 00:15:12.912
Understood. My terminal will be there shortly.

00:15:12.912 --> 00:15:15.290
Please wait until then.

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:16.916
All right.

00:15:32.349 --> 00:15:37.854
Fon-Fon, it's there.
It is already ready to record.

00:15:37.854 --> 00:15:39.522
Thank you very much.

00:15:39.522 --> 00:15:43.735
Looks like they're about ready to start here.

00:15:52.869 --> 00:15:54.579
They're here.

00:15:54.579 --> 00:15:56.414
Contaminoids?

00:15:59.876 --> 00:16:01.503
Sir!

00:16:01.961 --> 00:16:03.963
It's about time we head out.

00:16:10.136 --> 00:16:15.183
Don't worry about my fights.
Just be sure to record the mercenaries.

00:16:15.183 --> 00:16:19.187
Understood. You are not at optimal condition,

00:16:19.187 --> 00:16:21.398
so do not do anything reckless.

00:16:21.398 --> 00:16:23.024
I won't.

00:16:28.279 --> 00:16:30.407
Let's start at the same time.

00:16:30.407 --> 00:16:33.284
Letting even one of these head
toward Zuellni will cause problems.

00:16:33.284 --> 00:16:37.789
Who do you think you're talkin' to?
We're the dogs of the battlefield.

00:16:37.789 --> 00:16:41.751
But don't think we're some little
pups that're gonna let others tell us

00:16:41.751 --> 00:16:43.294
how to bite.

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:46.172
Enough boasting already.

00:16:48.133 --> 00:16:50.385
Don't let a single one remain!

00:16:55.306 --> 00:16:57.308
It's huntin' time!

00:16:58.518 --> 00:17:00.353
Restoration-02!

00:17:19.289 --> 00:17:21.791
The next one! Restoration-01!

00:17:24.919 --> 00:17:26.546
Fon-Fon!

00:17:27.047 --> 00:17:29.132
No need to worry.

00:17:30.633 --> 00:17:33.636
The wound on my back
opened up a little, that's all.

00:17:33.636 --> 00:17:35.555
There is nothing "little" about that at all.

00:17:35.555 --> 00:17:40.185
It's a little. It hurts,
but it's not as if my suit got ripped.

00:17:41.186 --> 00:17:43.229
There's no way I can stop now.

00:17:43.229 --> 00:17:45.857
The time for stopping is when you're dead.

00:17:45.857 --> 00:17:52.655
I'm in good form...
Like today, I could even cut the sky.

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:09.255
Restoration-AD!

00:18:15.595 --> 00:18:18.973
No matter how many times I see it,
it's still awesome.

00:18:18.973 --> 00:18:22.560
Is this... is it a dream?

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:25.021
Never mind me, just look over there!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.223
Excellently done.

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:06.604
They scatter, feint, and seal off
the contaminoids' movements.

00:19:06.604 --> 00:19:11.401
Which is when that man, Haia,
comes in and finishes them.

00:19:11.401 --> 00:19:13.903
But compared to Layfon...

00:19:22.662 --> 00:19:24.664
Are you all right?

00:19:31.588 --> 00:19:36.634
Theirs is the way that
contaminoid fighting should be done.

00:19:36.634 --> 00:19:40.055
My way is what reckless idiots do.

00:19:40.055 --> 00:19:43.558
The way I fight, one wrong
move means immediate death.

00:19:43.558 --> 00:19:46.644
A single mistake takes
you straight to the grave.

00:19:46.644 --> 00:19:49.689
Because no one can take that mistake back.

00:19:49.689 --> 00:19:55.612
That's why I wanted you to see.
Even if it's not now, then next time...

00:19:55.612 --> 00:19:58.823
Or if that's no good,
then the time after next...

00:20:00.075 --> 00:20:02.494
I want us to fight together!

00:20:07.791 --> 00:20:09.959
That's some pretty heavy shit to drop on us.

00:20:09.959 --> 00:20:11.294
Sorry.

00:20:11.294 --> 00:20:16.257
Still, having you rely on
us ain't such a bad feeling.

00:20:16.257 --> 00:20:19.052
Siena, this is the 17th Platoon.

00:20:19.844 --> 00:20:21.846
Not bad, huh?

00:21:05.724 --> 00:21:08.935
I wonder if Nina will get
bent out of shape if we don't hurry

00:21:08.935 --> 00:21:11.646
and show her the footage Felli-<i>chan </i>took.

00:21:17.068 --> 00:21:17.861
Well?!

00:21:17.861 --> 00:21:20.488
Nina Antalk is nowhere to be found.

00:21:22.824 --> 00:21:25.035
Where the heck did she go?

00:21:39.549 --> 00:21:42.344
This concludes Vanzeh Hardi's report.

00:21:42.344 --> 00:21:45.013
Nina Antalk has "disappeared"?

00:22:01.613 --> 00:22:03.239
<i>Layfon...</i>

00:22:26.262 --> 00:22:36.356
<i>Hello, who are you thinking of?</i>

00:22:36.356 --> 00:22:43.446
<i>This letter still lies within my breast</i>

00:22:43.446 --> 00:22:53.498
<i>That fragment of memories</i>
<i>of you, suddenly encountered,</i>

00:22:53.498 --> 00:23:00.588
<i>has pierced my heart and I can't move</i>

00:23:00.588 --> 00:23:05.427
<i>I want you to notice, don't notice</i>

00:23:05.427 --> 00:23:09.139
<i>Do you treat me coldly because of love?</i>

00:23:09.139 --> 00:23:18.732
<i>I want to tell you "Be by my side," </i>
<i>but I can't say it</i>

00:23:19.524 --> 00:23:28.116
<i>It was in this filthy world</i>
<i>that I was able to meet you</i>

00:23:28.116 --> 00:23:39.294
<i>Please play this miracle</i>
<i>that has descended to my heart</i>

00:23:39.294 --> 00:23:47.302
<i>Zuellni my love</i>

00:23:53.892 --> 00:23:55.810
<i>Leerin departs Glendan,</i>
<i>headed for Zuellni, and along the way</i>

00:23:55.810 --> 00:23:57.312
<i>encounters the academic city Myath.</i>

00:23:57.312 --> 00:24:00.398
